<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―I could hear it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sound announcing the start of battle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These were no ordinary footsteps.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the sound of fate, given form, being carried before us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Thank you for waiting. Russian-roulette takoyaki, 12 pieces, two duds." [TN: takoyaki: fried batter balls with octopus inside]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
At last, the thing in question had been delivered before us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or so it should have been, but―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ロシアンたこ焼き\ロシアンたこ焼き箱.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Wh... what is this...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What had been set on the table was a small <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="かんおけ">coffin</STYLE> about 30 centimeters long.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The takoyaki were in this thing...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What a tasteless setup! Is this a dig at me, since today's the anniversary of my <STYLE ID="2">dad</STYLE>'s death!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then, as our eldest, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> should open it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Do be... careful..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"It's an important role, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... Break the seal..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not you two too, quit making it all creepy! What part of this is an important role!?<PG>
Calm down, me... What's in here is just takoyaki, after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why am I this nervous just about opening a box of takoyaki...
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Okay, I'm opening it...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\dvd-case-takeout1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\噴出音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Whoa...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thick smoke billowed out from inside, and everything was swallowed in a pure-white darkness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What a pointless production...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Damn! If I <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ひる">flinch</STYLE> at something like this, I'll never make it through this battle!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
―Gradually the smoke cleared, and the whole picture came into view.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ロシアンたこ焼き\ロシアンたこ焼き背景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
