{MESON "500"}
Inside the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="かんおけ">coffin</STYLE>, 12 takoyaki waited quietly for their moment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<BR>
What is this...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Normally these all look the same, but these Russian-roulette takoyaki were 
{PAUSE ""}
red, 
{PAUSE ""}
green, 
{PAUSE ""}
yellow, 
{PAUSE ""}
black...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
