{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I sensed an eerie bloodlust coming from the black ones in particular.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The black ones are seriously no good! They're not something you can look at head-on...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For the sake of anyone watching, self-censorship is required...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
