{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> picked up the menu.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Let's see... Looks like the Russian-roulette takoyaki here have a different spice at random. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Habanero, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">wasabi, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Japanese mustard, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">and then... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">'Black Death Devil Pepper'?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What kind of spice is that, with a never-heard-of, <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="まがまが">sinister</STYLE> name like that!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now even Zahha's taking the joke way too far!<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Of course, there are only two hits in here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So just because one is red doesn't necessarily mean it has habanero in it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So if it's red, habanero, 
{PAUSE ""}
if green, wasabi, 
{PAUSE ""}
if yellow, Japanese mustard, 
{PAUSE ""}
and if black, a hit of Black Whatever Pepper, <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="・・・・・・">maybe</STYLE>. Is that the idea?<PG>
