{MESON "500"}
As before, I picked up the yellow one with my chopsticks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Well, well... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, I didn't know you loved pumpkin so much. I'll bake you a pumpkin cake for your next birthday. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Which spice would you like in it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Don't take her bait...! Believe in yourself! In the you who made it this far...!!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
