{MESON "500"}
<TXSPS>Huh...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something was wrong...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't taste anything...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had my tongue gone numb...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had I lost?<PG>
My mouth... wouldn't move...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't... smell anything...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The flavor... the texture... all five senses, stolen...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Robbed of every sensation, I was locked inside a <STYLE ID="16" RUBY="ろうごく">prison</STYLE> of thought.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<TXSPN>No, my senses are just dulled by the extreme tension!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Feel it! You have to feel it! The flavor of pumpkin!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The wind and the scent of the soil in the pumpkin fields...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "20" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
