{PLAYSND "HIRAHIRA.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―That was on last year's school trip.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\北海道.gal" "NORMAL" "20" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Our destination: Hokkaido.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The day I left Honshu for the first time and set foot on the land across the sea.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\北海道1.gal" "NORMAL" "20" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Hokkaido's <STYLE ID="17" RUBY="ふらの">Furano</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's also known for melons, but the pumpkins the melon farmers grow are famous too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\北海道2.gal" "NORMAL" "20" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That's it. The aroma spreading through my mouth was the same as the pumpkin I tasted in Hokkaido's <STYLE ID="17" RUBY="ふらの">Furano</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "20" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The moment I recognized it, the sweet aroma of pumpkin spread rapidly through my mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the taste of victory, together with nostalgia and deep emotion.<PG>
I'm still just a fledgling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I never knew the taste of victory, or the taste of pumpkin, could bring such joy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
