{MESON "500"}
A single tear ran down my cheek as I gazed at <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'll be looking forward to that pumpkin cake..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\glass-break4.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
The glass of water <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE> was gripping shattered.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"That's </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> for you. Truly worthy of being </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">my best friend</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That shrimp</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> can't hold a candle to you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'm honored to have fought </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. Win or lose, I have no regrets. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'm thankful that I could give it my all like this, and thankful to </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> for bringing me this match."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"My, what a lovely thing to say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But sadly, every match must end, and a winner must be decided. The moment I eat the next one, everything will be settled. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Still, for reference, tell me. Green or black... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, which do you think is the hit?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE> narrowed her eyes and spoke in a gentle tone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I too lamented this match's <STYLE ID="18" RUBY="しゅうえん">end</STYLE>, and told <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE> my own <STYLE ID="15" RUBY="ストラテジ">strategy</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I think black is the hit. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">And what's inside it is </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="B">Black</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="D">Death</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="D">Devil</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="21" RUBY="P">Pepper</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"That's </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> for you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">From Zahha's point of view, you stage it so black lasts to the end, and plant your trump-card spice in it: </STYLE><STYLE ID="22" RUBY="B">Black</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="23" RUBY="D">Death</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="23" RUBY="D">Devil</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="24" RUBY="P">Pepper</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE> had noticed too. Zahha's side of things, which <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>'s probability calculations alone couldn't reveal...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means <STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE> will pick green next.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If our prediction is right―I lose...<PG>
