<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Why!? Isn't that dangerous!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, have you forgotten? I chose black in round two, did I not?</STYLE>
