{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">before that, someone is sure to get hit with another color. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">And I figured </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, who can calculate probabilities, was less likely to draw a hit than </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE><PG>
