<STYLE ID="5">"If </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> got hit with something other than black, I, going first, would eat one more black than </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE>
