{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Just as I expected, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> fell for my feint, picked black, and drew the hit. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But that it was not </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> but </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> who fell for the feint was a miscalculation... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, unlike </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, thought only about the probabilities in front of her and forgot to read Zahha's intentions. </STYLE>
