<STYLE ID="5">would be a failure as entertainment!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ridiculous! Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="B">Black</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="D">Death</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="D">Devil</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="21" RUBY="P">Pepper</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> would have to be in a color other than black!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Hitting at the very end is what makes it </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="B">Black</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="D">Death</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="D">Devil</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="21" RUBY="P">Pepper</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, but this way it'd hit someone at some half-baked moment!</STYLE>
