<STYLE ID="4">　That's the unimaginative idea! In fact, black has lasted this long, and still nobody's been hit with </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="B">Black</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="D">Death</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="D">Devil</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="21" RUBY="P">Pepper</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!"</STYLE><PG>
